+hears or sees (aria-label, title, alt, placeholder, page metadata) and element ids; raw TeX delimiters
+in reader text or TeX in an attribute also fail. Warnings, which do not block, list words that may be
+workflow residue for the content writer to read, formulas written outside TeX delimiters, and
